                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/1028: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Whitehouse</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-27T18:00:00-05:00">December 27, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>79. Your 121, December 23, 2 p.m. Has third designado Luis Chacon resigned? Did
                    Palma resign as second designado or only as provisional president?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
